This compatibility branch retains the Ubuntu Stonking source identity
pyqt6-sip 13.12.0-1 for SBI's prepared-source discovery. Its runtime is
generated from StableKite/sip commit bc7c3368a54fd33434db7e7b17ca64359d8f1bad
and targets ABI 14.0 on Python 3.15 or later.

To reproduce the runtime source archive from that SIP checkout:

    python3.15 -m sipbuild.tools.module --abi-version 14.0 --sdist PyQt6.sip

Use the runtime with PyQt6 and extension modules built against the same ABI.
